id: og_refuge_c
name: Refuge III
description: Refuge. A building small enough that nothing in it is more than fifteen metres from anything else, over a cellar cut into the rock it stands on. Built as a high mountain refuge; the wardens closed it for the season and the cellar hatch was left off.

